Core/Jessie: You keep saying they’re slower at night. Why?
Core/Rose: Photosynthesis. They need sunlight for energy.
Core/Jessie: So at night they’re basically… running on fumes?
Core/Rose: Exactly. Sluggish. Disoriented. Still dangerous, but less dangerous.
Core/Jessie: I’ll take what I can get.
Core/Rose: That’s the spirit.